    "title": "Navatulya\u00ae Natural Fluorite Colorful Striped Crystal Healing Stone",
    "body_html": "<div style=\"margin: 0.0px auto;\">\n<p style=\"overflow: hidden; height: 1.0px; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">34699</p>\n<div style=\"padding: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; ;color: #000000;\">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/Navatulya_2_2048x2048.png?v=1567444461\" alt=\"Navatulya\u00ae natural fluorite colorful striped crystal healing stone\" loading=\"lazy\">\u00a0</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">BUY MORE SAVE MORE</span> <br><span style=\"color: #9900ff;\">1 for 499</span><br><span style=\"color: #9900ff;\">2 for 899</span><br><span style=\"color: #9900ff;\">3 for 1199</span></span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 10.0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></span><span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: #e06666;\">Length</span> - 4.2 to 5 cm</span></span>\n</h1>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Product Description:</span></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Hand-polished process with 100% natural fluorite.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Each pure natural fluorite quartz crystal has its own unique lines, which is a unique gift.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Fluorite is also known as \"soft crystal or colorful gem\", which can help to eliminate the negative energy accumulation in the body and remove the bad luck.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Product Parameters:</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Line: unique piece due to natural formation</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Size: Length about 4.2 - 5 cm</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Color: colorful</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Material: Natural Fluorite Quartz Crystal</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Note:<br> Each product is pure natural and unique, not exactly the same. There may be cracks for some products, which are naturally formed and not damaged by other objects.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Packing List:</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin: 10.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">1 x Fluorite Crystal Bar</span></span></p>\n<img alt=\"ZZP71109826_20171109040808247\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1RZzcqH1YBuNjSszhq6AUsFXar.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"ZZP71109826_20171109040807962\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1_C5eiDXYBeNkHFrdq6AiuVXaE.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"ZZP71109826_20171109040808423\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1ej_XqN1YBuNjy1zcq6zNcXXaS.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"ZZP71109826_20171109040809832\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1Gh1vfAUmBKNjSZFOq6yb2XXaw.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"ZZP71109826_201711090